<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>为新疆人民打出一个民主联合政府</title>
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: #e9eaed;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }

        .document {
            width: 560px;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        /* Decorative top and bottom patterns */
        .pattern-header, .pattern-footer {
            height: 100px;
            background-color: #1a223f;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .pattern-header::before, .pattern-footer::before {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
            background-image: 
                radial-gradient(circle at 25px 0, transparent 18px, #12182d 19px, #12182d 21px, transparent 22px),
                radial-gradient(circle at 25px 25px, transparent 18px, #12182d 19px, #12182d 21px, transparent 22px);
            background-size: 50px 25px;
            opacity: 0.7;
        }

        .content {
            padding: 45px 35px 50px 35px;
            color: #1a1a1a;
            font-family: -apple-system, "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", "Noto Sans SC", sans-serif;
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 1.85;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }

        .heading {
            font-size: 19px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 35px;
            color: #000;
        }

        p {
            margin-top: 0;
            margin-bottom: 32px;
            text-align: justify;
        }

        p:last-child {
            margin-bottom: 0;
        }

        .marker-underline {
            text-decoration: underline;
            text-decoration-color: #e51d19;
            text-decoration-style: solid;
            text-decoration-thickness: 4px;
            text-underline-offset: 6px;
            text-decoration-skip-ink: none;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="document">
        <div class="pattern-header"></div>

        <div class="content">
            <div class="heading">2、为新疆人民打出一个民主联合政府</div>

            <p>受到长期迫害的新疆各族人民奋勇反抗，发动了伊犁、塔城、阿山三区人民革命。革命军队很快占领了以上三个地区，成立了临时革命政府。</p>

            <p>三区人民革命让盛世才感受到了各族人民抗争的力量，最终在革命力量和国民政府的双重压力下败走新疆。1945年日本投降以后，国民政府在全国各族人民的多方压力下，与临时革命政府开启谈判，假借谈判的手段分化瓦解革命力量。</p>

            <p><span class="marker-underline">恐怕谈判桌上的所有人都不会想到，赛福鼎以后会成为新中国的副国级领导人。</span></p>
        </div>

        <div class="pattern-footer"></div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
